icated green parklands compared to suburban master communities."]},{id:"palm-jumeirah",slug:"palm-jumeirah",image:"/images/districts/palm-jumeirah.jpg",name:"Palm Jumeirah",developer:"Nakheel",overview:"The world-renowned palm tree-shaped archipelago extending 5 kilometers into the Arabian Gulf. A global synonym for beachfront villas, private marinas, and landmark resort supertowers.",urbanConcept:"Engineered through vibro-compaction of 94 million cubic meters of marine sand and 7 million tons of quarried Hajar mountain rock. The masterplan comprises a central 2 km Trunk, 16 residential Fronds, and an 11 km breakwater Crescent connected via a 6-lane sub-sea vehicular tunnel. Adds 78 kilometers of private beachfront to Dubai's coastline.",keyLandmarks:["Atlantis The Royal (KPF / WET Design)","Burj Al Arab (adjacent Jumeirah coastline)","The Palm Tower & AURA Skypool (240 m)","Atlantis, The Palm","One Palm by Omniyat (SOMA Architects)"],averageRoi:"7.8% - 10.2%",iconicTowersCount:18,description:"Palm Jumeirah is the undisputed global capital of waterfront ultra-prime real estate. Land on the island is completely exhausted, creating an absolute physical supply cap. Consequently, luxury apartments in landmark towers like Atlantis The Royal and The Palm Tower command world-record price appreciations and astronomical short-term holiday rates.",subZones:[{name:"The Crescent (Breakwater)",character:"Resort palaces, 5-star branded residences (Atlantis The Royal, One&Only, W Residences) and private beach clubs.",pricePerSqFtAed:"4,500 - 11,000 AED/sq.ft",bestFor:"Global billionaires, branded lifestyle suites, and trophy asset collections."},{name:"The Trunk (Central Spine)",character:"High-density luxury apartment buildings (Marina Residences, Shoreline, The Palm Tower) with retail hubs (Nakheel Mall).",pricePerSqFtAed:"2,200 - 4,000 AED/sq.ft",bestFor:"Liquid holiday-let investments and high rental yield apartments with private beach club access."},{name:"The Fronds (A to N)